# Binary per-cell outputs exceed the 64 KB data-file policy and the artifact store refuses uploads from this runtime.
# They stay on the run host; data/SHA256SUMS records them and data/json/ holds lossless JSON mirrors (exported after the run).
data/**/*.npz
data/*.npz
analysis/gains.csv
# appended by the L5 lead (phase 2): line-delimited outputs are also ignored; their lossless JSON mirrors are in data_json/
data/**/*.jsonl
data/*.jsonl
__pycache__/
